{"anon_id": "P3-f837932c", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "乡试果登榜已合，惟量级断不拔尖而实次岁联捷，酉日坐标部分对齐"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f85e404a", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "果借斧已合；结局未载时点，无时点可核（中性记 1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f893dbbc", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 2, "pass": false, "gap_note": "近段果全愈一面合，惟终局后复发而死且愈日丁亥非所断午日"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f8aa9567", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "来客后逮问一面合，惟断非显达而实为知府进士；无时点可核（中性记 1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f8abcdd8", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f908317a", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f94d33a9", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f999d721", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 2, "pass": false, "gap_note": "功名果成一面合，惟断乡试中举而实奉诏授提督，机制与六月非酉月皆偏"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fa21b9eb", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "有功名已合而量级大低估，实官至元戎将军；无时点可核（中性记 1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-faad0ad8", "direction": 1, "claims": 0, "timing": 0, "total": 1, "pass": false, "gap_note": "断婚可成，实聘定四月未及成婚被贼兵劫去，成婚断语证伪"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fae64ae6", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "子果归已合，惟应期断酉日而实丁卯日至"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fb1006d7", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fb4ba127", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 2, "pass": false, "gap_note": "发迹果应已合，惟断午年而实丑年发甲"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fc01ab98", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "子果寻见于岳家已合，惟酉方酉日未证；无时点可核（中性记 1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fc9c803a", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "父终绝于亥月已合，惟近段断危笃而实目下先愈，亥日偏为亥月尺度部分对齐"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fd4c715f", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 1, "total": 1, "pass": false, "gap_note": "断父凶险生还望薄，实二月得意而回；卯月时点与定论期部分对齐而方向全反"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fdd0b802", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fefb7db0", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 1, "total": 1, "pass": false, "gap_note": "断子病难愈，实午日起床病愈；午日坐标虽中而所应为愈非危"}
{"anon_id": "P3-ff1c93bc", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "败选与罢免皆应，惟罢免实次年六月完成，所断数月内仅及进程，应期部分对齐"}
{"anon_id": "P3-ff77918b", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 0, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "不得利压货大亏已合，惟断本季辰月定局而实积压四年，应期尺度大偏"}
